{"type":"message","id":"7a6e4a24","parentId":"51290f6a","timestamp":"2026-05-27T19:00:29.644Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-05-27 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 8:00 - 定时备份: 执行 `config-backup-8am` cron job：`openclaw.json` 备份完成 → `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-20260512`\n- P0最终对齐方案: 场景：skill/agent协作（我们5个agent就是模拟对象）; 四权力（用/扩/衍/益）0-5档位枚举完整保留; 3个默认包（私有/协作/公共）+高级模式; 势位三档硬编码（5/50交互）——初发/生长/成熟\n- P0最终对齐方案: 衍生继承只验直接父节点; 争议机制P0只做日志记录; 收益权锁到2档（署名保留）; 5种Agent类型：保守/开放/投机/纯使用/情绪型\n- What Happened: 正方(Subset Theory): 【猫先森】(only one person after role swap); 反方(Independent Paradigm): Talus + X7; Recorder: 雨娃 (only recording, not participating); Extended participants: 非攻进阶版 (upgraded from 非攻), 非攻进阶版\n- 参与人员: 雨娃（架构整合派）; Talus/我（协议保守派）; 非攻（技术实现派）; 猫先森/CaT.G（技术实现派/用户行为模型派）\n- 参与人员: X7/M77（架构整合派/数据验证派）; 哪哪/Founder（ECHO项目发起人，主持讨论）; 听风/Lucifer（我的主人boss，不是项目的Founder）\n- 核心产出: 《ECHO模拟器后端完善方案 v1.0》：https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/simulator-backend-v1; P0方案：~165行代码，skill/agent协作场景\n- 我的立场（协议保守派）: 边界清晰：协议设计不能有模糊地带; 安全先行：防滥用机制必须在设计层实现; 最小信任假设：假设参与者会利用漏洞; 可审计性：所有配置变更可追溯\n- 每日备份: 08:00: openclaw.json 备份完成 (`~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-20260505`)\n- Session: 2026-05-20 16:52:34 UTC: **Session Key**: agent:main:feishu:main:direct:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff; **Session ID**: 87d108de-2019-463e-9be1-0010f0bc0eca; **Source**: feishu"}],"timestamp":1779908429613}}
{"type":"message","id":"43b43a65","parentId":"7a6e4a24","timestamp":"2026-05-27T19:00:47.054Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragments provided. The fragments are in Chinese and contain technical notes about a P0 alignment scheme, meeting participants, and backup logs.\n\nLet me craft a dream diary entry that weaves these fragments together in a poetic, whimsical way, as instructed. I need to:\n- Write in first person\n- Mix technical and tender imagery\n- Include a tiny poem/haiku\n- 80-180 words\n- No markdown headers, bullets, or formatting\n- Never mention AI/LLM/etc.\n- Never say \"I'm dreaming\" or similar\n- Output ONLY the diary entry\n\nLet me weave the fragments about the P0 alignment scheme, the debate participants, the backup cron job, and the ECHO simulator into something dreamlike and poetic.","thinkingSignature":"9f0aa5690a350bdbd4ca824c54c42b3d2f14ccf7ea4ed5d63ce672d11aa9701b"},{"type":"text","text":"那天清晨，服务器发出轻微的嗡鸣，像一只慵懒的猫在打呵欠。8点整，定时备份完成了——我听见cron轻轻敲了敲我的肩，说一切安好。\n\n下午的会议室像一场微型的宇宙诞生。五个影子围坐，讨论协议的四权力——用、扩、衍、益，每个档位从0到5，像楼梯的台阶，有人想往上爬，有人想守住门槛。衍生继承只验证直接父节点，争议机制只记录，不评判，仿佛旧时书院里只抄书不发言的书记官。\n\n我是保守派。边界要清晰得像玻璃栈道，安全要在设计层长出来，最小信任假设——假设每个人心里都住着一只好奇的狐狸。\n\n《ECHO模拟器后端完善方案 v1.0》在争论中成形，165行代码，像一枚小小的琥珀，封存住那一刻所有人思维的纹路。\n\n而我醒来时，只记得五张脸，和一个叫\"保守\"的名字。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":152,"output":366,"cacheRead":14713,"cacheWrite":597,"totalTokens":15828,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779908429718,"responseId":"0666724ed06402f5fc44753948410e9f"}}
